<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=utf-8><title>Conscious - parent updates for tutors</title><style>body{font-family:sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 16px}input,textarea{width:100%;margin:4px 0;padding:6px}textarea{height:70px}button{padding:8px 16px}pre{background:#f3f3f8;padding:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;border-radius:8px}</style></head><body><h1>Conscious</h1><p>Write a warm, specific parent update in 30 seconds. Fill in the session notes; copy the message.</p>
