<script>
function m(){o.textContent=`Hi! This is ${tu.value||'your tutor'} with a quick update on ${st.value||'your child'}'s ${su.value||'session'} today.

Wins: ${w.value||'Great focus and effort.'}

Focus area: ${g.value||'We will keep building confidence.'}

Next step: ${hw.value||'Short practice before our next session.'}

See you ${nx.value||'next time'}. Reply anytime with questions!

- ${tu.value||'Tutor'}`}
</script></body></html>
